@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Your information";
}

<div class="client-portal-header">
    <div>
        <div class="section-kicker">Your account / Privacy information</div>
        <h1 class="client-portal-title">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
        <p class="client-portal-text">A clear view of the information you share when planning an event.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="dashboard-panel">
    <h2>Account and event details</h2>
    <p>You provide contact information when creating an account and event information when requesting a booking. Your account brings together your booking details, payment submissions, requests, and messages.</p>
    <h2>Payment submissions</h2>
    <p>Payment proofs are submitted for review. Check the selected image before uploading and share only the information needed for the transaction.</p>
    <h2>Keeping your details current</h2>
    <p>You can review and edit your contact details and manage your password from your profile.</p>
    <h2>Event feedback and public sharing</h2>
    <p>After a completed event, you may submit ratings, an experience answer, private suggestions, and optional photos. Authorized Staff can review your submission. Suggestions remain private. Public testimonials require your separate permissions for your experience and overall rating, chosen display name, and photos, followed by Staff approval.</p>
    <p>You can withdraw public-sharing consent from My feedback. This hides the testimonial and public photos while retaining your private submission and review history. Copies already downloaded by visitors cannot be recalled. Share photos only when you have permission from the people shown.</p>
    <p class="cr-notice mb-0">The business’s full privacy notice, including retention periods and a privacy contact, has not been supplied yet. This page will be updated with that approved notice before public launch.</p>
</div>
